{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: get stronger and go deeper. This is a game about the grind. You'll master the loop of digging for resources, crafting powerful gear, and using it to kill deadly monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig</strong><br>Explore five unique dig sites, each with different ores to mine for crafting better gear. Defeat dungeon bosses to unlock new locations, and spend gold dropped from monsters to regenerate dig sites for endless resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong><br>Forge equipment and infuse it with stats and effects using items collected from dungeon monsters. Combine three items of the same tier into stronger gear (common, uncommon, epic, and legendary). Upgrade your pickaxe for faster mining and bigger digs, and expand your inventory to carry more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill</strong><br>Battle monsters in turn-based combat throughout the dungeon. Enemies drop gold, essence, and special items to enhance your gear. Unlock new drops with essence and power up your equipment to take on tougher enemies and deadlier bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, Craft, Kill. This is the path to the bottom. Overcome the final boss to unlock Endless Mode and and see how far you can go.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832880?t=1758028487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/1c78d31bfd8b77591037f6682852de88dfc38c74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758028487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/b837fe52d21bebbb5bc92cc6570af95bdbc6101a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758028487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/b837fe52d21bebbb5bc92cc6570af95bdbc6101a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758028487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: get stronger and go deeper. This is a game about the grind. You'll master the loop of digging for resources, crafting powerful gear, and using it to kill deadly monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig</strong><br>Explore five unique dig sites, each with different ores to mine for crafting better gear. Defeat dungeon bosses to unlock new locations, and spend gold dropped from monsters to regenerate dig sites for endless resource gathering.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong><br>Forge equipment and infuse it with stats and effects using items collected from dungeon monsters. Combine three items of the same tier into stronger gear (common, uncommon, epic, and legendary). Upgrade your pickaxe for faster mining and bigger digs, and expand your inventory to carry more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill</strong><br>Battle monsters in turn-based combat throughout the dungeon. Enemies drop gold, essence, and special items to enhance your gear. Unlock new drops with essence and power up your equipment to take on tougher enemies and deadlier bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embrace the Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, Craft, Kill. This is the path to the bottom. Overcome the final boss to unlock Endless Mode and and see how far you can go.</p>","developers":["CloseEnoughGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832880/1afac287f2f8f4